1
00:00:00,840 --> 00:00:03,770
(Howard:)No!

2
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:15,350
(Bernadette:)Well, this was fun.

3
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:22,830
(Wyatt:)Oh! I think
I got a nibble.

4
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:24,610
Oh, be careful.

5
00:00:24,610 --> 00:00:27,250
(Leonard:)Give him some line.

6
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:29,730
(Leonard:)Okay, now reel him in.

7
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:31,770
(Wyatt:)Oh, look at that baby.

8
00:00:31,770 --> 00:00:33,270
(Wyatt:)They're really biting, huh?

9
00:00:33,270 --> 00:00:36,120
(Leonard:)Yeah. They do that
when you set it on easy.

10
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:40,780
(Wyatt(phone rings):)Oh, that's me.

11
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:42,300
(Sheldon:)Hello.

12
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:43,580
(Wyatt(phone rings):)Oh, hi, sweetie.

13
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,880
(Wyatt(phone rings):)Yeah, I got up early
and didn't want to wake you,

14
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:48,850
(Wyatt(phone rings):)so I went out for coffee and ran
into Leonard on the way back.

15
00:00:48,850 --> 00:00:51,590
(Wyatt(phone rings):)Guess what-- we're fishing.

16
00:00:51,590 --> 00:00:54,190
(Wyatt(phone rings):)Yeah. Right here on his couch.

17
00:00:55,010 --> 00:00:57,230
(Leonard:)Hey, baby. I love you!

18
00:00:59,030 --> 00:01:00,760
(Wyatt:)That's Leonard.

